        ],
        "byte_range": [
          18881,
          19006
        ],
        "text_sha256": "a856e99554271521412a41c08dd9f4c5356ba4b17dfc0f9545f7f7256fd68d37"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "name": "文化",
      "text": "**6｜文化**  \n38-A级：书案—妆奁争位置；旧帖只作旧生活痕迹；不全棋具只露一笔。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          480,
