        ],
        "text_sha256": "3297245dfe176707fa94e8c7e6627f501f27e2ff03dd00ea0b5eee850a87e9b5"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 9,
      "name": "宗教/梦",
      "text": "**9｜宗教/梦**  \n“前缘”不由仙人解释。潇湘馆是痕迹空间，不变祭坛。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
