        "text_sha256": "e3f9667772df039387b485c2ae230efab86cb86361296d65109c2e10ebe26b31"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 10,
      "name": "职业",
      "text": "**10｜职业**  \n裁缝、针线房、厨房、媒/礼务只露工序；不做婚俗博览。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
