        "text_sha256": "5c7f2161f09bd80af5764caf51bac9e0a66adcb16202bcd5ff1ed870a2d68d58"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 13,
      "name": "应删",
      "text": "**13｜应删**  \n骗婚、掉包、宝玉大闹；“悼黛即否定宝钗”；进入潇湘馆翻遗物；发现《续庄子》。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
        "lines": [
          501,
          503
        ],
        "byte_range": [
          20042,
          20176
        ],
        "text_sha256": "138b518e0d0b59cf358ceb18bf22d7554a3fcd17488730d93becb7033be04bb8"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 14,
      "name": "L3候选",
      "text": "**14｜L3候选**  \n婚议—婚礼—潇湘馆外景物反照—婚后可重新编排，使B03与B05互不抢戏；VW2-05不得承担回次固定功能。\n\n",
      "citation": {
        "path": "sources/project/cea77d0ec8777a39/81—100_二十回全幅补完卡_v2.6_引用标识修复版.md",
        "sha256": "cea77d0ec8777a39b5a36f77c1eebf9638c208ba6cb8b71e083908d7f6e3c99c",
